{"text": "June 27, 1955\n\nMe, F. Haydn Morgan\nAssistant Adninistrative Director of\nProject Research and Grants\nUniversity of Pennsylvania\nGraduate School of Medicine\n19th and Lombard Streets\nPhiladelphia 46, Pennsylvania\n\nDear Mr. Morgan:\n\nYou will find attached a check in the amount of\n$7,500.00, covering the third quarterly payment for the\nresearch project undertaken by Dr, Herbert R. Hawthorne,\nwhich becane active on February 1, 1955.\n\nSincerely,\nWe Ts Hoyt\nExecutive Secretary\nWIHretk\nEnclosure\n\ncc: Dr. Herbert R. Hawthorne", "words": [{"text": "June", "x0": 493, "y0": 205, "x1": 526, "y1": 216, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "27,", "x0": 534, "y0": 205, "x1": 554, "y1": 218, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "1955", "x0": 565, "y0": 205, "x1": 596, "y1": 216, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "Me,", "x0": 171, "y0": 278, "x1": 193, "y1": 290, "conf": 35.0}, {"text": "F.", "x0": 203, "y0": 279, "x1": 217, "y1": 290, "conf": 70.0}, {"text": "Haydn", "x0": 226, "y0": 279, "x1": 266, "y1": 293, "conf": 77.0}, {"text": "Morgan", "x0": 273, "y0": 280, "x1": 320, "y1": 292, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "Assistant", "x0": 171, "y0": 294, "x1": 242, "y1": 305, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "Adninistrative", "x0": 250, "y0": 294, "x1": 360, "y1": 306, "conf": 71.0}, {"text": "Director", "x0": 368, "y0": 295, "x1": 431, "y1": 306, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "of", "x0": 438, "y0": 295, "x1": 454, "y1": 306, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Project", "x0": 171, "y0": 309, "x1": 226, "y1": 322, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Research", "x0": 234, "y0": 309, "x1": 297, "y1": 320, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "and", "x0": 306, "y0": 309, "x1": 328, "y1": 320, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Grants", "x0": 336, "y0": 310, "x1": 383, "y1": 321, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "University", "x0": 171, "y0": 324, "x1": 250, "y1": 338, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "of", "x0": 258, "y0": 324, "x1": 273, "y1": 335, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "Pennsylvania", "x0": 281, "y0": 324, "x1": 376, "y1": 338, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "Graduate", "x0": 17